**/target/
**/.cargo
**/Cargo.lock
!Cargo.lock
.snapshot

# Commit the Android project (Tauri recommends it), so build customizations such as the debug app id persist.
gen/*
!gen/android/

# All icons can be easily generated through `cargo tauri icon`
icons/
# Some icons stay checked in to enable a smoother onboarding, because `cargo tauri dev` does not start without them
!icons/32x32.png
!icons/icon.icns
